IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0035.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY LON0035C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 TERM-CAP           PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 ELIG-IND           PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "TERM-CAP=" TERM-CAP
    DISPLAY "ELIG-IND=" ELIG-IND
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF CUST-AGE >= 18
        IF CUST-AGE > 65
            MOVE 10 TO TERM-CAP
            MOVE 'Y' TO ELIG-IND
        ELSE
            IF CUST-AGE > 55
                MOVE 20 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO ELIG-IND
            ELSE
                MOVE 30 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO ELIG-IND
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO ELIG-IND
    END-IF.
